    "identifier": "hoshi-kujaku-art-kujaku-beast",
    "description": "<p>You conjure star chakra until you summon a bestial like creature of your design generally called a Star Beast.</p>\n<p>The Star Beast has its listed statistics at the end of this clan and uses your Ninjutsu attack bonus or save DC when an effect calls for it. You can command them as a Bonus Action.</p>\n<p>Irradiated: The Kujaku Beast is fully irradiated and becomes a poisonous force on the battlefield. It gains its Radiation Aura ability.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 (or 2-star chakra).</p>",
